  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/03/IMG_5456.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La Secci&oacute;n de Secundaria Serra d&#39;Espad&agrave; de Onda ha acogido la tarde de este mi&eacute;rcoles la charla, organizada por el AMPA, Internet y la redes sociales en el rendimiento escolar, a cargo de Macarena Gonz&aacute;lez.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaxarxessocialssecciosecundariaonda/img_5455.jpg\" alt=\"img_5455\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaxarxessocialssecciosecundariaonda/img_5457.jpg\" alt=\"img_5457\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaxarxessocialssecciosecundariaonda/img_5458.jpg\" alt=\"img_5458\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/xerradaxarxessocialssecciosecundariaonda/img_5459.jpg\" alt=\"img_5459\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
